renders/

# Raw corpus source (re-download via docs/README.md's setup command if needed; the mined
# derivative, engine/corpus_model_jazz.json, is what the engine actually uses and IS tracked).
corpus_raw/

# Local OTel-hooks capture state (real Claude Code session telemetry, for the real-trace roadmap
# item -- see docs/BUILD_NOTES.md). Stays local, never committed, never leaves this machine
# unless explicitly exported/shared.
.otel-hook-data/

# Personal/local Claude Code settings -- machine-specific permission overrides, not project config.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Internal dev log and pre-submission strategy notes -- candid reasoning (bug post-mortems,
# acceptance-strategy/venue-shopping notes, review calibration) never meant to ship publicly.
# Kept locally (backed up outside the repo too) so CLAUDE.md's "read BUILD_NOTES.md every
# session" instruction still works; just no longer committed. See CLAUDE.md's pre-public
# checklist for why these two specifically were pulled before the repo went public.
docs/BUILD_NOTES.md
paper/working-notes.md

# ScholarOne submission artifact -- generated from the .md source for the actual journal
